cff-version: 1.2.0
type: dataset
title: "Hotel Corporate Codes: a source-linked corporate-rate code dataset"
message: "Cite the fixed snapshot for reproducibility. The production Zenodo DOI will be added after registration."
authors:
  - family-names: "Zhu"
    given-names: "Long Quan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-4540-8082"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/adsorgcn/hotel-corporate-codes"
url: "https://hotelcorporatecodes.com"
version: "1.1.0+doi.1"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
abstract: "Hotel Corporate Codes contains 290 hotel corporate-rate code records across 10 hotel groups, plus five car-rental records, distributed as JSON and the MIT-licensed npm package @adsorgcn/hotel-corporate-codes. Of the hotel records, 286 were synchronized from HotelCorporateCodes.com; four cite official pages for IHG Global E and Wyndham Access Development, OfferFit, and Passport Unlimited. Unknown fields remain null. Historical discounts and identification reports are not current booking guarantees. A separate maintenance branch publishes reviewed source changes; incorporation into the package and website is a separate step. Data files are fixed at main commit 1a577d8; this archive also includes citation metadata."
keywords:
  - "hotel corporate rates"
  - "corporate negotiated rates"
  - "rate fences"
  - "fixed-tier pricing"
  - "hotel revenue management"
  - "eligibility"
  - "JSON dataset"
  - "hospitality"
